#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Container Engine
#  File: container_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS container engine responsible for:
#      • container lifecycle
#      • image building & layers
#      • namespace isolation (simulated)
#      • resource limits
#      • container telemetry
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Image Building](ca://s?q=Explain_Container_Image_Building)
#    - [Container Lifecycle](ca://s?q=Explain_Container_Lifecycle)
#    - [Resource Limits](ca://s?q=Explain_Container_Resource_Limits)
#    - [Isolation Model](ca://s?q=Explain_Container_Isolation_Model)
#    - [Container Telemetry](ca://s?q=Explain_Container_Telemetry)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - build_image(name, layers)
#         Builds container image.
#
#    - create_container(image, cpu_limit, mem_limit_mb)
#         Creates container instance.
#
#    - start(cid)
#         Starts container.
#
#    - stop(cid)
#         Stops container.
#
#    - destroy(cid)
#         Deletes container.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns container engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  CONTAINER STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "CTR-XXXX",
#      "image": "base.system",
#      "cpu_limit": 2,
#      "mem_limit_mb": 512,
#      "state": "running/stopped",
#      "created": <epoch>
#    }
#
